OL,3,GNEWSAWoman's 'ordinary' aunt hid WW2
OL,4,Acommandos from Nazis
OL,5,
OL,6,F"To everybody else [she] was just a
OL,7,Flittle ordinary Guernsey lady" an
OL,8,Fislander has said of her late aunt, who
OL,9,Fhid British commandos in her shed
OL,10,Fduring the Nazi occupation.
OL,12,FLiz Walton has been exploring evidence
OL,13,Fof the heroic actions of Ada Le
OL,14,FPoivedin, using boxes of old photos,
OL,15,Fnewspaper cuttings and documents she
OL,16,Fhad, as well as historical records from
OL,17,Fan ancestral research company.
OL,19,FShe found Ada and her husband Walter
OL,20,FBourgaize hid the elite soldiers in
OL,21,F1941 after a failed raid due to "tides
OL,22,Fthey think were bigger than expected".
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
